# <PROJECT_NAME> Version History

Private operational history for projects that use notes/control files.

Public repos usually use `CHANGELOG.md`, Git tags, and GitHub Releases. Use this file when a project also needs deploy proof, exact SHAs, smoke checks, rollback notes, or operational context that does not belong in the public changelog.

Newest entries go at the top.

## <VERSION> — YYYY-MM-DD — <one-line summary>

- PR: #<num-or-none>
- SHA: <full-sha>
- Deployed/Released: <environment-or-release-channel>
- Verification: <command-or-smoke-test-result>
- Rollback: <rollback-sha-or-plan>
- Notes: <short operational detail>
